  "notes": [
    "Deira Cold Store & General Trading is deliberately absent from the supplier master. The correct outcome is an unresolved-supplier review, not a silent match.",
    "Printed unit prices already include 5% VAT. header.net_before_tax below is the net figure; an extractor that reports the gross as net will disagree with the goods receipt by exactly the VAT.",
    "Descriptions are the supplier's own names, not inventory names. expected_inventory_code on each line is the mapping answer; a run that reads the text correctly and still maps wrongly fails this case.",
    "No pack size is printed on this document, so pack_quantity is null on every line. expected_base_quantity is still given, but it is only derivable after the line is mapped to a supplier item, not from the page."
  ],
